Changes (2026-11-12, for the Unio project): only the test groups of ML-DSA-65 that Unio
uses are kept, with the values unchanged, the fields not needed dropped, and the JSON
re-indented:

  ml-dsa-65-keygen.json  keyGen group 2 (25 cases): tcId, seed, pk, sk
  ml-dsa-65-siggen.json  sigGen groups 3 (external interface, pure, deterministic) and
                         15 (external interface, pure, randomized with the given rnd),
                         15 cases each: tcId, message, context, rnd, sk, signature
  ml-dsa-65-sigver.json  sigVer group 3 (external interface, pure), 15 cases, valid and
                         invalid: tcId, testPassed, reason, pk, message, context, signature

